why: "あの子は優しすぎる。 on COMIC OGYAAA!!, whose own feed title is\n  COMIC OGYAAA!! (コミックオギャー)｜おもしろい、がうまれるところ（あの子は優しすぎる。）\n\
  THE PLATFORM NAME CONTAINS BRACKETS, which is the counter-case. A greedy match ran\
  \ from the first\nopener to the last closer, so 23 series here were named after\
  \ the platform and its tagline with the\nreal title trapped on the end, and four\
  \ of them reached the published database. No feed on any other\nGigaViewer platform\
  \ shows this, because no other platform brackets its own name.\nThe subtitle is\
  \ cut BECAUSE IT IS THE PUBLISHER SYNOPSIS, which REQUIREMENTS §2 forbids storing.\n\
  Nothing reads it and a fixture is committed."
